{"about_the_game":"<strong>Hunt superheroes, steal their powers, save the world.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297490/extras/71d3ed6cc465814aed6aadf49430cb7d.poster.avif?t=1709228083\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297490/extras/71d3ed6cc465814aed6aadf49430cb7d.webm?t=1709228083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297490/extras/71d3ed6cc465814aed6aadf49430cb7d.mp4?t=1709228083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Team up with friends to battle evil, mutated superhero bosses and their army of twisted henchmen.<br><br><br><strong>Level up your characters</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297490/extras/8ac0835f5739e98dadbef62c0333a517.poster.avif?t=1709228083\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297490/extras/8ac0835f5739e98dadbef62c0333a517.webm?t=1709228083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297490/extras/8ac0835f5739e98dadbef62c0333a517.mp4?t=1709228083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose from a cast of characters with their own unique look and playstyle. Permanently customize your character's skill tree as you gain levels to gain the edge in future attempts.<br><br><br><strong>Dynamically configured missions</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297490/extras/6753b8480573dbf8d68dc7cdf68c06df.poster.avif?t=1709228083\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297490/extras/6753b8480573dbf8d68dc7cdf68c06df.webm?t=1709228083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297490/extras/6753b8480573dbf8d68dc7cdf68c06df.mp4?t=1709228083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight in a sprawling, hyper-stylized superhero universe through multiple biomes. Each run you mission objectives, routes, and adversaries will be reconfigured. You'll never know what waits around the next corner.<br><br><br><strong>Millions of combinations</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297490/extras/4d568260c24e29aa073d1b3972f9dfb0.poster.avif?t=1709228083\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297490/extras/4d568260c24e29aa073d1b3972f9dfb0.webm?t=1709228083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297490/extras/4d568260c24e29aa073d1b3972f9dfb0.mp4?t=1709228083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>On any run you could find any combination of hundreds of different unique superpowers, weapons, items, and abilities. There are millions of potential combinations to try out.<br><br><br><strong>Epic boss fights</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297490/extras/2bf42240a005333c94b2bab673c3c332.poster.avif?t=1709228083\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297490/extras/2bf42240a005333c94b2bab673c3c332.webm?t=1709228083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297490/extras/2bf42240a005333c94b2bab673c3c332.mp4?t=1709228083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Face off against the toughest evil superheroes out there. Victor unlocks new categories of superpowers you may find in future runs.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"ea5f523713f8d2d4eb24ec74da23c69678727292.jpg","localized_name":"Spinal Tap","name":"Spinal Tap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1297490/ea5f523713f8d2d4eb24ec74da23c69678727292.jpg"},{"icon":"f9c228cc1541d3215d14a306082dc114fecb6f75.jpg","localized_name":"They're Not Dolls, They're Action Figures!","name":"They're Not Dolls, They're Action Figures!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1297490/f9c228cc1541d3215d14a306082dc114fecb6f75.jpg"},{"icon":"e8fd32ee72de04eacfd8e555e99fba3306001065.jpg","localized_name":"Reckoned With","name":"Reckoned With","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1297490/e8fd32ee72de04eacfd8e555e99fba3306001065.jpg"},{"icon":"20fd7b3ef807d28ac7d8a476177cb8ed5b0a9948.jpg","localized_name":"Surge Protector","name":"Surge Protector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1297490/20fd7b3ef807d28ac7d8a476177cb8ed5b0a9948.jpg"},{"icon":"e678ff47cd17e3085b08354d4cb0ff21a2323496.jpg","localized_name":"Brain Drain","name":"Brain Drain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1297490/e678ff47cd17e3085b08354d4cb0ff21a2323496.jpg"},{"icon":"078af9f80ae2a90fb2b49cd77ea2c97245dcd3ea.jpg","localized_name":"The Harder They Fall","name":"The Harder They Fall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1297490/078af9f80ae2a90fb2b49cd77ea2c97245dcd3ea.jpg"},{"icon":"749bef84fa58d984b41b5ba5347bab002bcbf791.jpg","localized_name":"Slow Burn","name":"Slow Burn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1297490/749bef84fa58d984b41b5ba534